IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-WM-SCSI-DIRECT.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-FRAMES          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 PAYLOAD-BYTES       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 BUS-CLOCK-GHZ       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-WM-SCSI.
    IF NUM-FRAMES == 0 OR PAYLOAD-BYTES == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 64200 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-FRAMES.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
